# Nix artifacts
#
# Templates ship unlocked so a consumer resolves current nixpkgs on first use,
# and none is re-included below today — the only tracked lock is the root's,
# which belongs to this repo's own flake and not to any template. Locking a
# template means adding `!/templates/<name>/flake.lock` here, and the
# lock-policy check enforces that it agrees with `locked` in
# meta/templates.nix — CLAUDE.md 5.
flake.lock
!/flake.lock

result
result-*
.direnv/

.claude/settings.local.json
